<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-thompson-scarus-pomacanthus> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson's Scarus -> Pomacanthus coordinate transformation fitted to real species (Scarus (22 spp.) and Pomacanthus (9 spp.), with Chaetodon (54 spp.) and 59 other genera for context; one photographed S. ghobban and one P. semicirculatus; Indo-Pacific shore fishes, lateral view)",
        "Thompson's Scarus -> Pomacanthus coordinate transformation fitted to real species faithfully reproduces Scarus (22 spp.) and Pomacanthus (9 spp.), with Chaetodon (54 spp.) and 59 other genera for context; one photographed S. ghobban and one P. semicirculatus; Indo-Pacific shore fishes, lateral view morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/thompson-scarus-pomacanthus-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/thompson-scarus-pomacanthus-2> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) thompson/1917-thompson-scarus-pomacanthus.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Scarus (22 spp.) and Pomacanthus (9 spp.), with Chaetodon (54 spp.) and 59 other genera for context; one photographed S. ghobban and one P. semicirculatus; Indo-Pacific shore fishes, lateral view specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 76.6/100, audit 2026-10-17-thompson-audit) and the assessments." ;
